  "summary": "➢\tWeb Developer for Leonard Golf Links (Dec 2009 – Present) – \n- Responsibilities include website design and maintenance, search engine optimization, managing the ecommerce site, incorporating social media, designing and sending eNewsletters, and data management \n\n➢\tWeb Developer for Pursuant (March 2008 – Dec 2009) – \n* Pursuant is a full service online fundraising company\n- Responsible for setting up and sending email campaigns and newsletters for colleges, churches, and non profits nation wide\n- Responsible for complete data setup and management \n\n➢\tStarted my own Website Design Business – DV8 Web Solutions \nAll my samples are on my site - http://dv8websolutions.com/gallery.htm\n\n➢\tPlayed professional golf for 2 years including on the LPGA (2006-2007)\n\nSkills Include:\n- HTML\n- ASP\n- Dreamweaver\n- Fireworks\n- Flash\n- Microsoft Word, Access, Excel\n- SQL\n- Campaign Enterprise\n- CSS\n- JavaScript\n- PHP\n- Photoshop\n- Enable Mail\n\nSpecialties: Services:\n•\tCustom Design\n•\tComplete Site Setup\n•\tDomain Registration/Hosting \n•\tSearch Engine Optimization\n•\teCommerce Setup\n•\teNewsletters\n•\tData Management\n•\tSocial Media/Blogs\n•\tEmail Address Setup\n•\tSite Maintenance\n•\tPayPal Account Setup\n•\tFlash Slideshows, Banners, Demos, & Animation \n•\tForm Creation \n•\tDatabase Creation & Management\n•\tPhoto Editing & Scanning\n•\tVideo Converting & Embedding",
